<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2><span class="bar"></span>Our Story</h2>
    <p>Analytico LLC was started by Bill Young, Ph.D., an engineer by training and an analytics professor by
    trade. What began as a few designs for friends and family grew into a shop with thousands of original
    designs, covering hobbies, careers, faith, holidays and the small moments people like to celebrate.</p>
    <p>The name comes from that analytics background. We treat every design like a small experiment: we
    try it, see what people respond to, and keep improving, so the right design finds the right person.</p>
  </div>
</section>

